#: src/ui/login.rs:156
#, rust-format
msgid "Spotifast {version} • not affiliated with Spotify"
msgstr "Spotifast {version} • 与 Spotify 无关"

#: src/ui/login.rs:170
msgid ""
"That doesn't look like a Client ID. It is 32 letters and digits, shown on "
"Spotify's page for your registration."
msgstr ""
"这看起来不像 Client ID。Client ID 由 32 个字母和数字组成，显示在 Spotify 上你"
"的注册页面中。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:174
msgid ""
"Spotify doesn't know this Client ID. Copy it again from Spotify's developer "
"dashboard."
msgstr "Spotify 不认识此 Client ID。请从 Spotify 开发者控制台重新复制。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:178
msgid ""
"Spotify didn't let this account use this Client ID. Sign in with the Spotify "
"account that registered it, which needs Premium."
msgstr ""
"Spotify 不允许此账户使用此 Client ID。请使用注册它的 Spotify 账户登录，该账户"
"需要 Premium。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:182
msgid ""
"Spotify no longer accepts the shared sign-in Spotifast used before. Register "
"Spotifast to keep listening."
msgstr ""
"Spotify 已不再接受 Spotifast 以前使用的共享登录。请注册 Spotifast 以继续收"
"听。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:219
msgid "A native Spotify client."
msgstr "原生 Spotify 客户端。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:283
msgid "Waiting for Spotify in your browser…"
msgstr "正在等待浏览器中的 Spotify…"

#: src/ui/login.rs:291
msgid "Didn't open? Open the sign-in page again"
msgstr "没有打开？重新打开登录页面"

#: src/ui/login.rs:307
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"If Spotify says “Invalid redirect URI”, add {uri} to your registration "
"exactly, save, and sign in again."
msgstr ""
"如果 Spotify 显示“Invalid redirect URI”，请将 {uri} 原样添加到你的注册信息"
"中，保存后重新登录。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:360
msgid "Sign in with Spotify"
msgstr "使用 Spotify 登录"

#: src/ui/login.rs:371
msgid ""
"Sign in through your browser. Spotifast never sees your password. Local "
"playback needs Spotify Premium."
msgstr ""
"通过浏览器登录。Spotifast 永远不会看到你的密码。本地播放需要 Spotify "
"Premium。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:380
msgid "How to register Spotifast"
msgstr "如何注册 Spotifast"

#: src/ui/login.rs:404
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "代理设置"

#: src/ui/login.rs:454
msgid ""
"A Client ID is 32 letters and digits. Copy it from Spotify's developer "
"dashboard."
msgstr "Client ID 由 32 个字母和数字组成。请从 Spotify 开发者控制台复制。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:514
msgid ""
"Spotify asks you to register Spotifast once, on an account with Premium. It "
"takes about two minutes and gives you a Client ID."
msgstr ""
"Spotify 要求你用具有 Premium 的账户注册一次 Spotifast。大约需要两分钟，完成后"
"你会得到一个 Client ID。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:524
msgid "Open Spotify's developer dashboard."
msgstr "打开 Spotify 开发者控制台。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:545
msgid ""
"Click Create app, Spotify's name for this registration. Any name will do."
msgstr "点击“Create app”，这是 Spotify 对此注册的叫法。名称随意。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:553
msgid "Under Redirect URIs, add exactly:"
msgstr "在“Redirect URIs”中准确添加："

#: src/ui/login.rs:562
msgid "Tick Web API, accept the terms, and save."
msgstr "勾选“Web API”，接受条款并保存。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:569
msgid "Paste the Client ID into the field and sign in."
msgstr "将 Client ID 粘贴到输入框并登录。"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:488
msgid "Spotify is being slow on the shared sign-in."
msgstr "Spotify 在共享登录上响应缓慢。"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:491
msgid ""
"Spotifast no longer offers the shared sign-in, and Spotify can stop "
"accepting it at any time. Register Spotifast and you won't have to wait."
msgstr ""
"Spotifast 已不再提供共享登录，Spotify 也随时可能停止接受它。注册 Spotifast，"
"就不用再等待了。"

#. Translators: a button that opens a page explaining why
#. the banner it sits in appeared.
#: src/ui/mod.rs:502 src/ui/mod.rs:534
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "为什么？"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:525
msgid ""
"Spotify refused the key that unlocks the audio. Spotifast can't fix that, "
"but it sometimes clears up on its own. You can still play on your phone or "
"another Spotify device."
msgstr ""
"Spotify 拒绝提供解锁音频的密钥。Spotifast 没法解决，但有时过一会儿会自己恢"
"复。你仍然可以在手机或其他 Spotify 设备上播放。"

